    "text": "# **Step 4: Preparation of ISM061-21** \n\nTo a solution of **compound 21-3** (10 mg, 0.04 mmol) in DCM (1 mL) were added 5-methyl-1Hindazol-4-amine (7.2 mg, 0.05 mmol), Titanium tetraisopropanolate (37 mg, 0.13 mmol). The reaction mixture was stirred at 25 ℃ for 12 h. After the addition of NaBH3CN (5.5 mg, 0.09 mmol), the mixture was further stirred at 25 ℃ for 2 hr. The reaction mixture was filtered and concentrated under reduced pressure to give a residue, which was purified by Prep-HPLC to afford the title compound (1.14 mg, 7.2% yield). LCMS (ESI<sup>+</sup> ): 358.3 [M+H]<sup>+</sup> ;<sup>1</sup> H NMR (400 MHz, DMSO- _d_ 6) δ 12.64 (s, 1H), 8.60 (s, 1H), 7.86 (s, 1H), 7.27 – 7.17 (m, 1H), 7.13 – 7.08 (m, 2H), 7.05 (d, _J_ = 8.3 Hz, 1H), 6.74 (d, _J_ = 8.2 Hz, 1H), 5.65 (t, _J_ = 6.3 Hz, 1H), 4.85 (d, _J_ = 6.1 Hz, 2H), 2.61 (s, 3H), 2.26 (s, 3H), 1.95 (s, 6H). \n\n\n\n**S1.9. Preparation of ISM061-22** \n\n\n\n**Scheme S8** Preparation of ISM061-22 \n\n"
